### Version

1.59.1

### Steps to reproduce

With `javaScriptEnabled: false`, an actionability retry that has to wait never finishes waiting. The retry backoff is an in-page `setTimeout`, and timers don't run while script execution is disabled.

Self-contained reproduction (no server; the page is served by `route`):

```js
// repro.mjs — node repro.mjs
import { chromium } from "playwright";

// The button is covered for 300 ms by an overlay that a pure-CSS animation hides; no script involved.
const html = `<!doctype html><style>
#cover{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.1);animation:gone 0s linear .3s forwards}
@keyframes gone{to{visibility:hidden}}
</style><form action="/done"><button>Continue</button></form><div id="cover"></div>`;

for (const [label, opts] of [["bundled", {}], ["chrome", { channel: "chrome" }]]) {
  const browser = await chromium.launch(opts);
  for (const javaScriptEnabled of [true, false]) {
    const context = await browser.newContext({ javaScriptEnabled });
    await context.route("http://repro.test/**", (r) => r.fulfill({ contentType: "text/html", body: r.request().url().includes("/done") ? "done" : html }));
    const page = await context.newPage();
    await page.goto("http://repro.test/");
    const t = performance.now();
    const outcome = await page.getByRole("button", { name: "Continue" }).click({ timeout: 90_000 }).then(() => "clicked", (e) => e.name);
    console.log(label, browser.version(), `javaScriptEnabled=${javaScriptEnabled}`, outcome, `${((performance.now() - t) / 1000).toFixed(2)}s`);
    await context.close();
  }
  await browser.close();
}
```

### Expected behavior

The click succeeds shortly after the overlay disappears (~0.3–1 s), as it does with JavaScript enabled.

### Actual behavior

| Browser | `javaScriptEnabled: true` | `javaScriptEnabled: false` |
|---|---|---|
| Bundled Chromium headless shell 147.0.7727.15 | 0.34 s | **30.13 s** |
| Google Chrome 153.0.8010.54, headless | 0.38 s | **never completes** (`TimeoutError` at 90 s) |
| Google Chrome 153.0.8010.54, headed | — | **never completes** (90 s timeout; separate run) |

